{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22313","headline":"秋霖中过尹纵之仙游山居 · 白居易","name":"秋霖中过尹纵之仙游山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惨惨八月暮，连连三日霖。\n邑居尚愁寂，况乃在山林。\n林下有志士，苦学惜光阴。\n岁晚千万虑，幷入方寸心。\n岩鸟共旅宿，草虫伴愁吟。\n秋天牀席冷，夜雨灯火深。\n怜君寂莫意，携酒一相寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22313.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22313","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}